(3470968, 485855, 39144, '<td valign="top">Wow. There are some brilliant portraits in this group. This is definitely ribbon material. Nice job. The clarity and colors are excellent.</td>', 'Wow. There are some brilliant portraits in this group. This is definitely ribbon material. Nice job. The clarity and colors are excellent.', '2007-03-19 00:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
