(3470973, 484176, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the idea.  The tilt of the tractor is a touch "off" but I love that he''s in his own environment. Wish the focus on the farmer were a bit better.</td>', 'I love the idea.  The tilt of the tractor is a touch "off" but I love that he''s in his own environment. Wish the focus on the farmer were a bit better.', '2007-03-19 00:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
