(3470997, 485124, 19982, '<td valign="top">Wow, porcelain skin that I bet a lot of models would just die for.  The pose is interesting, albeit a tad stiff, but I think that tends to "fit" with her svelte figure.  I would have preferred to see catch lights in her eyes to give her face a little more life.</td>', 'Wow, porcelain skin that I bet a lot of models would just die for.  The pose is interesting, albeit a tad stiff, but I think that tends to "fit" with her svelte figure.  I would have preferred to see catch lights in her eyes to give her face a little more life.', '2007-03-19 00:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
