(3472590, 485855, 15204, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Great sharpenss and colors.  I like the model''s hands up near her face, too, especially with your compostion.  I think your main light is a little low.  The catchlights are at 7 or 8 o''clock in her eyes, instead of 10 o''clock and the nose shadow goes up her face towards the eye instead of under her nose.  Other than that, I think this is spot on.  7 from me.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Great sharpenss and colors.  I like the model''s hands up near her face, too, especially with your compostion.  I think your main light is a little low.  The catchlights are at 7 or 8 o''clock in her eyes, instead of 10 o''clock and the nose shadow goes up her face towards the eye instead of under her nose.  Other than that, I think this is spot on.  7 from me.', '2007-03-19 12:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
