(3473403, 485692, 55199, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of eye color and background.  Lovely.</td>', 'Nice contrast of eye color and background.  Lovely.', '2007-03-19 17:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3473420, 485587, 15711, '<td valign="top">There she is again.  WOW the aubergine color really suits her lips and eye color.  Stunning. She seems mature beyond her years. 9</td>', 'There she is again.  WOW the aubergine color really suits her lips and eye color.  Stunning. She seems mature beyond her years. 9', '2007-03-19 17:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3473422, 485522, 55199, '<td valign="top">I''m seeing odd pixels, especially at his eyes, but there seems to be pixelating elsewhere too, such as on his cuff, on his right shoulder (our left), on his right hand, and on his hair.  If I move back I don''t notice it as much... maybe scaling down a little would fix it?  If you getting a lower score than you''d expected, maybe thats why.  Nice choice of DOF.</td>', 'I''m seeing odd pixels, especially at his eyes, but there seems to be pixelating elsewhere too, such as on his cuff, on his right shoulder (our left), on his right hand, and on his hair.  If I move back I don''t notice it as much... maybe scaling down a little would fix it?  If you getting a lower score than you''d expected, maybe thats why.  Nice choice of DOF.', '2007-03-19 17:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3473423, 485340, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great focus.  Her eyes are wonderful.  I''m not crazy about the boards - they tend to be a touch distracting.  The skin tones are a bit yellow but that''s easily fixed using Photoshop or other editing software.</td>', 'Great focus.  Her eyes are wonderful.  I''m not crazy about the boards - they tend to be a touch distracting.  The skin tones are a bit yellow but that''s easily fixed using Photoshop or other editing software.', '2007-03-19 17:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
