(3473716, 485426, 50695, '<td valign="top">some spectacularly good technique on lighting the background/foreground, but there''s something "stiff" about the child''s face, it almost seems a doll''s face. the pose is a little stiff as well. A "stiff" "unnatural" model can work with the right technique, but with this technique it seems sentimental.</td>', 'some spectacularly good technique on lighting the background/foreground, but there''s something "stiff" about the child''s face, it almost seems a doll''s face. the pose is a little stiff as well. A "stiff" "unnatural" model can work with the right technique, but with this technique it seems sentimental.', '2007-03-19 18:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3473718, 485025, 55199, '<td valign="top">Those look like wine barrels and he looks too grumpy to be a wine maker.  Guess those aren''t wine barrels though eh?  Colors, focus and all that are good.</td>', 'Those look like wine barrels and he looks too grumpy to be a wine maker.  Guess those aren''t wine barrels though eh?  Colors, focus and all that are good.', '2007-03-19 18:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
