(3474519, 485351, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, I bet you''ll get so much crap for this being blurry. But I LIKE IT. It really looks amazing.  The lighting and the pose are very dramatic and I really think the soft focus adds to this feeling.</td>', 'Oh wow, I bet you''ll get so much crap for this being blurry. But I LIKE IT. It really looks amazing.  The lighting and the pose are very dramatic and I really think the soft focus adds to this feeling.', '2007-03-20 01:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
