(3474566, 485670, 70000, '<td valign="top">haha I like what the distortion does here, its a shame that the sunny parts are so blown but that just makes it all the more natural, thats truly what light does in those conditions, nice capture</td>', 'haha I like what the distortion does here, its a shame that the sunny parts are so blown but that just makes it all the more natural, thats truly what light does in those conditions, nice capture', '2007-03-20 02:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
