(3475250, 485692, 24073, '<td valign="top">A good portrait obviously, but IMO her eyes seem over-processed.  I was also wondering if the blues (foreground, and background) wouldn''t be better off as contrasting colors instead of matching.  It might of given it more pop.  Still a good photo, very good.  GL.</td>', 'A good portrait obviously, but IMO her eyes seem over-processed.  I was also wondering if the blues (foreground, and background) wouldn''t be better off as contrasting colors instead of matching.  It might of given it more pop.  Still a good photo, very good.  GL.', '2007-03-20 12:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
