(3475299, 484256, 63269, '<td valign="top">Here''s my two cents. :)<br/>I''m not sure having the girl in blue was a good idea... blue is a sort of "cold" color, and it makes this picture feel a little chilly, which doesn''t quite work with the "warm" yellow-green background. But otherwise, this is pretty cool! Good shot!</td>', 'Here''s my two cents. :)I''m not sure having the girl in blue was a good idea... blue is a sort of "cold" color, and it makes this picture feel a little chilly, which doesn''t quite work with the "warm" yellow-green background. But otherwise, this is pretty cool! Good shot!', '2007-03-20 12:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
