(3475311, 484994, 63269, '<td valign="top">This looks like it would be a really sweet shot if it weren''t for the colors... They feel off here - I''m not sure if that''s just the way the photo was processed or if the white ballence was off, but the things that should be white here are kind of bluish, and everything else has a redish hue to it. But I love the girl''s expression - it''s really cute. Also a good idea for a portrait! Keep trying! :)</td>', 'This looks like it would be a really sweet shot if it weren''t for the colors... They feel off here - I''m not sure if that''s just the way the photo was processed or if the white ballence was off, but the things that should be white here are kind of bluish, and everything else has a redish hue to it. But I love the girl''s expression - it''s really cute. Also a good idea for a portrait! Keep trying! :)', '2007-03-20 12:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3475313, 485277, 63269, '<td valign="top">The background really adds to this - the way the bricks all lead your eye to his face is very creative!</td>', 'The background really adds to this - the way the bricks all lead your eye to his face is very creative!', '2007-03-20 12:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
