(3475320, 485840, 24073, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait, beautiful model.  The only problem I can reckognize here, is the amazing competition at hand.  You have to get more pizazz out of your photo to place high.  IMO, the white background could be better, it takes away from her beautiful brown skin.  Also, a brown skin person has an amazing advantage with jewelry.  IMO, gold, diomands, and maybe even pearls never look better than on brown skin, perhaps something like that could of been incorporated for more pop.<br/> <br/>A big gold looped earring, a nice bright choker, but not white.  And a changing of the background to a more settle solid color, and dim the lights.  I dont know if it''d work, but I''d certainly love the challenge.  All this, and I''m still giving the photo at hand a 7.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait, beautiful model.  The only problem I can reckognize here, is the amazing competition at hand.  You have to get more pizazz out of your photo to place high.  IMO, the white background could be better, it takes away from her beautiful brown skin.  Also, a brown skin person has an amazing advantage with jewelry.  IMO, gold, diomands, and maybe even pearls never look better than on brown skin, perhaps something like that could of been incorporated for more pop. A big gold looped earring, a nice bright choker, but not white.  And a changing of the background to a more settle solid color, and dim the lights.  I dont know if it''d work, but I''d certainly love the challenge.  All this, and I''m still giving the photo at hand a 7.', '2007-03-20 12:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3475321, 485823, 63269, '<td valign="top">Great lighting!</td>', 'Great lighting!', '2007-03-20 12:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
