(3475325, 485476, 24073, '<td valign="top">A tad bit goofy, but I love humor, and I love this shot.  I also love the way it makes me feel guilty for calling it goofy.  Its sort of goofy, in a serious, great photo type of way.  My fav so far, excellent job, and superior creativeness.  9+</td>', 'A tad bit goofy, but I love humor, and I love this shot.  I also love the way it makes me feel guilty for calling it goofy.  Its sort of goofy, in a serious, great photo type of way.  My fav so far, excellent job, and superior creativeness.  9+', '2007-03-20 12:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
