(3476392, 483744, 65468, '<td valign="top">Really like the close crop of this image and the eyes are absolutely beautiful, great color and makeup.  Would have rated it a 10 if the chin was not cut off.</td>', 'Really like the close crop of this image and the eyes are absolutely beautiful, great color and makeup.  Would have rated it a 10 if the chin was not cut off.', '2007-03-20 21:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
