(3476599, 485504, 66952, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting, colors and expression. Quiet and peaceful. I think I would have either preferred more of her to be in focus, or for the eyes to be in focus instead of the lips and chin. But it''s really a good portrait.</td>', 'Lovely lighting, colors and expression. Quiet and peaceful. I think I would have either preferred more of her to be in focus, or for the eyes to be in focus instead of the lips and chin. But it''s really a good portrait.', '2007-03-20 23:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476605, 485291, 66952, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you went to a St Patrick''s Day parade. A good environmental portrait. Well framed, nice colors. He''s really focused on what he''s doing. I think it might be just a bit too busy. Kinda hard to make a shot of a guy holding bagpipes less busy, but there''s a lot of colors and shapes in the background that compete with the guy and his bagpipes.</td>', 'I''m guessing you went to a St Patrick''s Day parade. A good environmental portrait. Well framed, nice colors. He''s really focused on what he''s doing. I think it might be just a bit too busy. Kinda hard to make a shot of a guy holding bagpipes less busy, but there''s a lot of colors and shapes in the background that compete with the guy and his bagpipes.', '2007-03-20 23:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476606, 485657, 31403, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate the work that goes into a shot like this - however I would prefer more mystery in the lighting, more drama to match the dramatic makeup and hair.  The ponytail shadow across her face is unfortunate too.  6</td>', 'I can appreciate the work that goes into a shot like this - however I would prefer more mystery in the lighting, more drama to match the dramatic makeup and hair.  The ponytail shadow across her face is unfortunate too.  6', '2007-03-20 23:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476611, 483276, 31403, '<td valign="top">a little fill from a bounce card on the back side of her would add detail that my eye really wants to see.  Judicious application of shadow/highlight would do in a pinch.<br/> <br/>With that great look, more fill on the back may force me to give a 9 or 10 here, it''s a beautiful capture.<br/> <br/>I''m sure this is a treasure for the parents no matter what I think or what score you receive.  That is the magic of what we do, and your photo is priceless in that regard.  Nice work</td>', 'a little fill from a bounce card on the back side of her would add detail that my eye really wants to see.  Judicious application of shadow/highlight would do in a pinch. With that great look, more fill on the back may force me to give a 9 or 10 here, it''s a beautiful capture. I''m sure this is a treasure for the parents no matter what I think or what score you receive.  That is the magic of what we do, and your photo is priceless in that regard.  Nice work', '2007-03-20 23:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476614, 485843, 66952, '<td valign="top">It is a thoughtful portrait. You''ve gotten that to come across quite well. The colors are good, the model''s expression is quite thoughtful. I''m not sure doing a high key background works with this model. There''s a lot of contrast between the white background and the thick dark hair, and a lot of detail is lost in the hair, right in the middle of the frame. A darker background would allow you to expand the dynamic range in the midtones and shadows, and get more detail in the hair.</td>', 'It is a thoughtful portrait. You''ve gotten that to come across quite well. The colors are good, the model''s expression is quite thoughtful. I''m not sure doing a high key background works with this model. There''s a lot of contrast between the white background and the thick dark hair, and a lot of detail is lost in the hair, right in the middle of the frame. A darker background would allow you to expand the dynamic range in the midtones and shadows, and get more detail in the hair.', '2007-03-20 23:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476615, 485723, 31403, '<td valign="top">no, don''t look at the camera!  Then you would have a boring photo instead of this small piece of his personality captured forever.  Your flexibility and rolling with the situation landed you a treasure for sure.  7 (extra points for showing personality!)</td>', 'no, don''t look at the camera!  Then you would have a boring photo instead of this small piece of his personality captured forever.  Your flexibility and rolling with the situation landed you a treasure for sure.  7 (extra points for showing personality!)', '2007-03-20 23:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476620, 484695, 31403, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet you get a comment about too much NI.  I''ve shot kids though, and some have plastic smooth skin (and don''t even appreciate it).  so I''m giving your makeup and a smooth kid credit for this dreamy look.  You''ll have to let me know if I guessed right.  9</td>', 'I''ll bet you get a comment about too much NI.  I''ve shot kids though, and some have plastic smooth skin (and don''t even appreciate it).  so I''m giving your makeup and a smooth kid credit for this dreamy look.  You''ll have to let me know if I guessed right.  9', '2007-03-20 23:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476622, 485502, 31403, '<td valign="top">some will hate it, some will love it.  I appreciate the creativity - chalk me up for Love it!  8 for now</td>', 'some will hate it, some will love it.  I appreciate the creativity - chalk me up for Love it!  8 for now', '2007-03-20 23:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476624, 485129, 31403, '<td valign="top">yellow cast to this is unfortunate - WB setting on the camera or tweaking it in post processing would have been nice.  I''m wondering if cropping right down to her forehead and eye wouldn''t be a stronger composition - after all you only have to submit 640 pixels.  :-)</td>', 'yellow cast to this is unfortunate - WB setting on the camera or tweaking it in post processing would have been nice.  I''m wondering if cropping right down to her forehead and eye wouldn''t be a stronger composition - after all you only have to submit 640 pixels.  :-)', '2007-03-20 23:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476625, 485397, 66952, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, with the bride in front, and the groom at a distance. That works well. I like the vignetting, but it might be a bit heavy handed. It was the first thing I noticed when the picture came up. One thing that would make this shot work better would be to take care of the heavy shadows on the bride, either by shooting at a different time of day, or by using a diffusion panel in between the bride and the sun.</td>', 'I like the idea, with the bride in front, and the groom at a distance. That works well. I like the vignetting, but it might be a bit heavy handed. It was the first thing I noticed when the picture came up. One thing that would make this shot work better would be to take care of the heavy shadows on the bride, either by shooting at a different time of day, or by using a diffusion panel in between the bride and the sun.', '2007-03-20 23:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476629, 484403, 31403, '<td valign="top">all those beautiful warm tones - and her JARRING pink nails just smack you upside the head!  Can''t be helped though - looks like she paid a lot for that pink.<br/> <br/>Overall this feels too processed to me.  It''s left photography and approaches illustration.  A neat trick no doubt, one that I can appreciate in other applications - but doesn''t work for me here.  6</td>', 'all those beautiful warm tones - and her JARRING pink nails just smack you upside the head!  Can''t be helped though - looks like she paid a lot for that pink. Overall this feels too processed to me.  It''s left photography and approaches illustration.  A neat trick no doubt, one that I can appreciate in other applications - but doesn''t work for me here.  6', '2007-03-20 23:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476632, 485845, 66952, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice, colorful, duck(?) portrait. I would usually mark down for an animal in a portrait challenge, but, frankly it''s the best picture I''ve seen in the last 10 minutes.</td>', 'It''s a nice, colorful, duck(?) portrait. I would usually mark down for an animal in a portrait challenge, but, frankly it''s the best picture I''ve seen in the last 10 minutes.', '2007-03-20 23:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
