(3476639, 485828, 31403, '<td valign="top">hmmm, art or portrait - how does one draw the line?  I hardly see this as what he would send a 5x7 and three wallets to his mom - but you were darn creative and made me feel something.<br/> <br/>I''m going with artistic expression of an otherwise boring challenge - 7  Nice work - and thanks for making me stop to think!  :-)</td>', 'hmmm, art or portrait - how does one draw the line?  I hardly see this as what he would send a 5x7 and three wallets to his mom - but you were darn creative and made me feel something. I''m going with artistic expression of an otherwise boring challenge - 7  Nice work - and thanks for making me stop to think!  :-)', '2007-03-20 23:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476640, 485671, 66952, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I''ll say double trouble. They look like they could be a handful. Nicely posed and lit. The kid on the right''s hair is a bit overdone, but that''s minor.</td>', 'Yeah, I''ll say double trouble. They look like they could be a handful. Nicely posed and lit. The kid on the right''s hair is a bit overdone, but that''s minor.', '2007-03-20 23:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
