(3479760, 485671, 64489, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this photograph.  Of all the "posed" portraits in this contest, the expressions in this one feel the most genuine to me.  Great backlighting, a wonderful, natural rake across their faces, and just enough catchlight to really bring out the personality in their eyes.  If I were to make any critical comments, I would say that you might want to bring the key around to the front just a *hair* so that the ping in the eye of the boy on the left is a bit stronger, and I feel the right side could''ve been cropped off ever so slightly to balance some of the empty space on that side.  Otherwise, fantastic entry and a beautiful "color portrait."</td>', 'I absolutely love this photograph.  Of all the "posed" portraits in this contest, the expressions in this one feel the most genuine to me.  Great backlighting, a wonderful, natural rake across their faces, and just enough catchlight to really bring out the personality in their eyes.  If I were to make any critical comments, I would say that you might want to bring the key around to the front just a *hair* so that the ping in the eye of the boy on the left is a bit stronger, and I feel the right side could''ve been cropped off ever so slightly to balance some of the empty space on that side.  Otherwise, fantastic entry and a beautiful "color portrait."', '2007-03-21 21:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
