(3481471, 485393, 64795, '<td valign="top">One of my top pictures in this challenge! Hope to see it front page.</td>', 'One of my top pictures in this challenge! Hope to see it front page.', '2007-03-22 13:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3481542, 485397, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the groom standing in the back. For a portrait, I would like to see the bride''s eyes.</td>', 'I like the groom standing in the back. For a portrait, I would like to see the bride''s eyes.', '2007-03-22 14:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3481548, 485537, 66384, '<td valign="top">Interesting man and composition. I like the lighting, but the facial expression is not good.</td>', 'Interesting man and composition. I like the lighting, but the facial expression is not good.', '2007-03-22 14:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3481555, 485369, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very handsome model. I like everything about this shot except the rotation. It makes me turn my head to try to see it better and he looks very uncomfortable without back support.</td>', 'Very handsome model. I like everything about this shot except the rotation. It makes me turn my head to try to see it better and he looks very uncomfortable without back support.', '2007-03-22 14:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3481562, 485692, 66384, '<td valign="top">What unusual eyes. This is lovely. Everything sparkles, and there is just enough softness to her skin tone. My only complaint is the width of the image. It seems to be cropped a little too much on the right and appears to be a tight fit. I might have even left a little more at the top, so we could see her complete hairline/forehead.</td>', 'What unusual eyes. This is lovely. Everything sparkles, and there is just enough softness to her skin tone. My only complaint is the width of the image. It seems to be cropped a little too much on the right and appears to be a tight fit. I might have even left a little more at the top, so we could see her complete hairline/forehead.', '2007-03-22 14:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3481566, 485225, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love it.</td>', 'Love it.', '2007-03-22 14:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3481575, 485466, 66384, '<td valign="top">Either she has a bad rash, or there is too much noise. I think it would be good to tone down the red a bit.</td>', 'Either she has a bad rash, or there is too much noise. I think it would be good to tone down the red a bit.', '2007-03-22 14:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3481584, 485518, 66384, '<td valign="top">I understand that a portrait can be of something other than a human being, but I think of a portrait as being of a single specimen. This is a beautiful shot of a bunch of flowers, and I think would have been much better for the Free Study challenge.</td>', 'I understand that a portrait can be of something other than a human being, but I think of a portrait as being of a single specimen. This is a beautiful shot of a bunch of flowers, and I think would have been much better for the Free Study challenge.', '2007-03-22 14:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3481588, 485785, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and effective processing.</td>', 'Very interesting and effective processing.', '2007-03-22 14:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3481598, 484537, 66384, '<td valign="top">She looks quite uncomfortable and unnatural in that pose in those dressy clothes. You captured a very lovely expression on her face, but because her legs, with the bright highlights, are in the foreground, it is difficult to appreciate her face in the distance.</td>', 'She looks quite uncomfortable and unnatural in that pose in those dressy clothes. You captured a very lovely expression on her face, but because her legs, with the bright highlights, are in the foreground, it is difficult to appreciate her face in the distance.', '2007-03-22 14:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3481602, 485653, 52549, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girl, beautiful portrait.</td>', 'Beautiful girl, beautiful portrait.', '2007-03-22 15:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3481603, 484641, 52549, '<td valign="top">Beautifully interesting face.</td>', 'Beautifully interesting face.', '2007-03-22 15:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3481609, 484797, 52549, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous child. Great lighting. I''d have loved just the face without all the clutter in the foreground.</td>', 'Gorgeous child. Great lighting. I''d have loved just the face without all the clutter in the foreground.', '2007-03-22 15:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3481615, 485064, 52549, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes, pretty girl. The only nit-pick I have are the very hairy eyebrows. For me, they distract from the eyes.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes, pretty girl. The only nit-pick I have are the very hairy eyebrows. For me, they distract from the eyes.', '2007-03-22 15:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3481617, 485351, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wish the focus wasn''t so soft (I feel like I need to go buy glasses). And where''s the blood? ("My head is bloody, but unbowed.") I really like the lighting and composition. 7</td>', 'Wish the focus wasn''t so soft (I feel like I need to go buy glasses). And where''s the blood? ("My head is bloody, but unbowed.") I really like the lighting and composition. 7', '2007-03-22 15:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
