(3481630, 485779, 52549, '<td valign="top">You''ve probably had enough comments on this not being a portrait, so I''ll leave that bit out ;-) Nice colours, good DOF and just what a Scot likes to see now and again.</td>', 'You''ve probably had enough comments on this not being a portrait, so I''ll leave that bit out ;-) Nice colours, good DOF and just what a Scot likes to see now and again.', '2007-03-22 15:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
