(3481634, 485834, 66384, '<td valign="top">The green of the wrap, pendant, and irises are great, but I don''t like the green in the hair, on the skin, and especially in the whites of her eyes. Also I with the pendant was in better focus.</td>', 'The green of the wrap, pendant, and irises are great, but I don''t like the green in the hair, on the skin, and especially in the whites of her eyes. Also I with the pendant was in better focus.', '2007-03-22 15:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
