(3483555, 485780, 73575, '<td valign="top">Pretty subject. Having said that, this picture could have been better. Her eyes are almost closed; I realize she''s looking below the camera, which you may have intended, but it feels like you caught someone laughing at your open zipper. Or maybe she''s just playing with a child who is cropped out, but that isn''t apparent. Almost makes her look cross-eyed.<br/>Also, her stance is akward, it seems like she''s hunching or leaning back on something; it feels very unbalanced, like there''s more happening to the right that whould have been included.<br/>On a positive note, I like the lighting and DOF; the focus is on her face, where it should be, not distractions behind her. Kind of pulls attention to the necklace as well.</td>', 'Pretty subject. Having said that, this picture could have been better. Her eyes are almost closed; I realize she''s looking below the camera, which you may have intended, but it feels like you caught someone laughing at your open zipper. Or maybe she''s just playing with a child who is cropped out, but that isn''t apparent. Almost makes her look cross-eyed.Also, her stance is akward, it seems like she''s hunching or leaning back on something; it feels very unbalanced, like there''s more happening to the right that whould have been included.On a positive note, I like the lighting and DOF; the focus is on her face, where it should be, not distractions behind her. Kind of pulls attention to the necklace as well.', '2007-03-23 14:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483581, 485340, 73575, '<td valign="top">good composition and decent lighting; very sweet. Coloring seems somewhat dull though... very nice overall though. 6</td>', 'good composition and decent lighting; very sweet. Coloring seems somewhat dull though... very nice overall though. 6', '2007-03-23 14:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483584, 485395, 73575, '<td valign="top">Purple hat society? Great caricature.</td>', 'Purple hat society? Great caricature.', '2007-03-23 14:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483625, 485229, 30982, '<td valign="top">Someone feed this woman!  Good shot, but a bit disconcerting because she''s so thin.  Edit to add that I realize the angle creates the thinness, and no disrespect to the model was intended at all.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-26 16:48:18.</i></td>', 'Someone feed this woman!  Good shot, but a bit disconcerting because she''s so thin.  Edit to add that I realize the angle creates the thinness, and no disrespect to the model was intended at all.', '2007-03-23 14:39:55.000000', '2007-03-26 17:48:18.000000', 1),
(3483626, 484713, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely natural portrait - the background enhances in my opinion.</td>', 'Lovely natural portrait - the background enhances in my opinion.', '2007-03-23 14:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483628, 485274, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good even lighting and very natural pose and smile.  A bit of color correction to remove some of the yellow would give this a more natural appearance.</td>', 'Good even lighting and very natural pose and smile.  A bit of color correction to remove some of the yellow would give this a more natural appearance.', '2007-03-23 14:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483629, 485649, 30982, '<td valign="top">She looks very friendly and kind, and she has a great smile.</td>', 'She looks very friendly and kind, and she has a great smile.', '2007-03-23 14:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483634, 485127, 30982, '<td valign="top">Comment only - this is a wonderful shot of Rowan and very aptly titled.  She does indeed look melancholy, though I suspect she was mostly of the "aww, c''mon mom, do we have to do this now?" mindset.</td>', 'Comment only - this is a wonderful shot of Rowan and very aptly titled.  She does indeed look melancholy, though I suspect she was mostly of the "aww, c''mon mom, do we have to do this now?" mindset.', '2007-03-23 14:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483639, 485651, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like your use of soft focus on this.  Very compelling eyes!</td>', 'I like your use of soft focus on this.  Very compelling eyes!', '2007-03-23 14:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483643, 483744, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the tight crop.  The eyes may be a bit overdone, but that''s the style these days and you did a good job making them sparkle.</td>', 'I like the tight crop.  The eyes may be a bit overdone, but that''s the style these days and you did a good job making them sparkle.', '2007-03-23 14:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483647, 485841, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color and light, and props!  What a delightful smile.</td>', 'Nice use of color and light, and props!  What a delightful smile.', '2007-03-23 14:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483652, 485538, 30982, '<td valign="top">I very much like this!</td>', 'I very much like this!', '2007-03-23 14:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483676, 485286, 30982, '<td valign="top">She doesn''t look a bit shy!  She looks quite self assured and perhaps a bit mishevous!</td>', 'She doesn''t look a bit shy!  She looks quite self assured and perhaps a bit mishevous!', '2007-03-23 14:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483684, 482988, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a priceless picture, though - this will be treasured, I''m quite sure!</td>', 'What a priceless picture, though - this will be treasured, I''m quite sure!', '2007-03-23 14:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483732, 485283, 57886, '<td valign="top">Great picture. Well performed (a little weird pp, but works here though...)</td>', 'Great picture. Well performed (a little weird pp, but works here though...)', '2007-03-23 15:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483734, 482988, 57886, '<td valign="top">I have actually, and I know what you mean :o) Nice shot..</td>', 'I have actually, and I know what you mean :o) Nice shot..', '2007-03-23 15:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483747, 485821, 57886, '<td valign="top">Funny.. well performed.</td>', 'Funny.. well performed.', '2007-03-23 15:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483751, 485111, 69573, '<td valign="top">nice!</td>', 'nice!', '2007-03-23 15:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483756, 485375, 57886, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.. good work.</td>', 'Nice picture.. good work.', '2007-03-23 15:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483770, 484982, 57886, '<td valign="top">Great picture. Great colors and nice DOF..</td>', 'Great picture. Great colors and nice DOF..', '2007-03-23 15:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483787, 485561, 57886, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. I would have loved to see a stronger color on her lips... But the eyes are nicely done (something strange on the white of the the right eye though)...</td>', 'Nice picture. I would have loved to see a stronger color on her lips... But the eyes are nicely done (something strange on the white of the the right eye though)...', '2007-03-23 15:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483855, 485615, 73575, '<td valign="top">great colors! A little too much flash, I think, she seems to be glistening... Love the eyes and expression, she seems so innocent and yet ready for some mischief. 6.5</td>', 'great colors! A little too much flash, I think, she seems to be glistening... Love the eyes and expression, she seems so innocent and yet ready for some mischief. 6.5', '2007-03-23 16:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483859, 484989, 73575, '<td valign="top">Obviously contacts or editing - there''s kind of a glow on the right edge of the right iris which I''m sure isn''t natural. The overhead angle makes it look like a caricature - big head with a tiny body somewhere below. Very good DOF; the lighting is good except the shadow of her nose makes her face seem non-symmetric.</td>', 'Obviously contacts or editing - there''s kind of a glow on the right edge of the right iris which I''m sure isn''t natural. The overhead angle makes it look like a caricature - big head with a tiny body somewhere below. Very good DOF; the lighting is good except the shadow of her nose makes her face seem non-symmetric.', '2007-03-23 16:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483884, 485587, 52285, '<td valign="top">Colours make this shot, and are just perfect.</td>', 'Colours make this shot, and are just perfect.', '2007-03-23 16:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484005, 485247, 57541, '<td valign="top">the background on this one is a bit distractig, and the man looks like he''s about to say something. that''s usually not the most photogenic moment ;)</td>', 'the background on this one is a bit distractig, and the man looks like he''s about to say something. that''s usually not the most photogenic moment ;)', '2007-03-23 18:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484091, 485568, 47316, '<td valign="top">I like the strong expression and the colors. The green eyes really pop with the scarf. I''m not a big fan of the editing though. Her face seems really splotchy and blured in parts and it takes away from the image.</td>', 'I like the strong expression and the colors. The green eyes really pop with the scarf. I''m not a big fan of the editing though. Her face seems really splotchy and blured in parts and it takes away from the image.', '2007-03-23 18:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484097, 485653, 47316, '<td valign="top">Very clean and sharp image. Nice colors. The face seems blown out in parts but it almost works for me. I don''t like the cropping however. Way too tight and makes it seem like a floating head, looks strange to me especially the way the hair is. I do like tight crops on the face but for me it''s ideal to cut the forehead and leave the chin and part of the neck.</td>', 'Very clean and sharp image. Nice colors. The face seems blown out in parts but it almost works for me. I don''t like the cropping however. Way too tight and makes it seem like a floating head, looks strange to me especially the way the hair is. I do like tight crops on the face but for me it''s ideal to cut the forehead and leave the chin and part of the neck.', '2007-03-23 18:47:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3484099, 485091, 47316, '<td valign="top">Interesting background but the theme doesn''t seem to go with it for me. I wish he was looking straight at the camera, it would be more intense.<br/> <br/>I more shallow depth of field would have added to this nicely.</td>', 'Interesting background but the theme doesn''t seem to go with it for me. I wish he was looking straight at the camera, it would be more intense. I more shallow depth of field would have added to this nicely.', '2007-03-23 18:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484104, 485726, 47316, '<td valign="top">The light on the top of her head is really strong and distracting. Has a snapshot quality to it. It is sometimes helpful when shooting outdoors to go in the shade but not too much so there is still plenty of ambient light. That helps to relieve squinting too.</td>', 'The light on the top of her head is really strong and distracting. Has a snapshot quality to it. It is sometimes helpful when shooting outdoors to go in the shade but not too much so there is still plenty of ambient light. That helps to relieve squinting too.', '2007-03-23 18:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484105, 485632, 47316, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and textures.</td>', 'Nice colors and textures.', '2007-03-23 18:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484114, 485186, 47316, '<td valign="top">Really cute! Love the depth of field and the sharpness in her eyes. The colors are really nice as well. Would love to see her with a natural smile or even a little tild of the head but I know that''s often hard with children!</td>', 'Really cute! Love the depth of field and the sharpness in her eyes. The colors are really nice as well. Would love to see her with a natural smile or even a little tild of the head but I know that''s often hard with children!', '2007-03-23 18:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484125, 485671, 47316, '<td valign="top">Cute with the messy hair! I would much rather see this in a natural setting and perhaps more of an interaction shot with eachother rather than a posed portrait.</td>', 'Cute with the messy hair! I would much rather see this in a natural setting and perhaps more of an interaction shot with eachother rather than a posed portrait.', '2007-03-23 18:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484126, 484221, 47316, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and lovely expression. Nice to see a model with character.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and lovely expression. Nice to see a model with character.', '2007-03-23 18:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484133, 485754, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Beautiful skin tone and lighting. The pose and model are beautiful too. I think the only small problem is the dark background behind her hair. 9</td>', 'Lovely. Beautiful skin tone and lighting. The pose and model are beautiful too. I think the only small problem is the dark background behind her hair. 9', '2007-03-23 18:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484140, 483824, 66384, '<td valign="top">Adorable expression and good focus. I think it would be better if you adjusted the color to reduce the blue cast.</td>', 'Adorable expression and good focus. I think it would be better if you adjusted the color to reduce the blue cast.', '2007-03-23 19:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484150, 485465, 66384, '<td valign="top">I was immediately drawn to the eyes because they seem unnatural. Perhaps they were over-sharpened. The rest of the portrait is very nice.</td>', 'I was immediately drawn to the eyes because they seem unnatural. Perhaps they were over-sharpened. The rest of the portrait is very nice.', '2007-03-23 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484152, 485147, 5728, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!</td>', 'Brilliant!', '2007-03-23 19:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484154, 485426, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice work. I can see the eyes have been worked on, maybe a tad too much, but overall good!</td>', 'Nice work. I can see the eyes have been worked on, maybe a tad too much, but overall good!', '2007-03-23 19:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484155, 485857, 66384, '<td valign="top">The soft focus on the lower face is distracting to me. Also I think it would be more effective if the stray hairs were removed.</td>', 'The soft focus on the lower face is distracting to me. Also I think it would be more effective if the stray hairs were removed.', '2007-03-23 19:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484159, 485687, 5728, '<td valign="top">A bit too high on the magenta tones here,</td>', 'A bit too high on the magenta tones here,', '2007-03-23 19:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484164, 485653, 5728, '<td valign="top">Love the atmosphere you have created, but the chin is cut off a little too much for me.</td>', 'Love the atmosphere you have created, but the chin is cut off a little too much for me.', '2007-03-23 19:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484166, 485131, 5728, '<td valign="top">A nice portrait, but just a tad oversharpened I think.</td>', 'A nice portrait, but just a tad oversharpened I think.', '2007-03-23 19:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484169, 485817, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think it would be more effective as a portrait if it was cropped to bring the girl in much closer, removing most of the railing and much of the distracting background above her head. I would keep only a few of the flowers on the right. The girl is lovely and has a very nice expression with nice light on her face.</td>', 'I think it would be more effective as a portrait if it was cropped to bring the girl in much closer, removing most of the railing and much of the distracting background above her head. I would keep only a few of the flowers on the right. The girl is lovely and has a very nice expression with nice light on her face.', '2007-03-23 19:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484172, 485124, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot! Love it 10!</td>', 'Wonderful shot! Love it 10!', '2007-03-23 19:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484175, 485633, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good work, just enough tonemapping without going overboard. Good one!</td>', 'Good work, just enough tonemapping without going overboard. Good one!', '2007-03-23 19:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484176, 485247, 66384, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for all the negative space on the sides. I think it would be more effective if cropped to portrait orientation. The subject is excellent in all ways: lighting, focus, color, etc. I like the processing. 8</td>', 'I don''t care for all the negative space on the sides. I think it would be more effective if cropped to portrait orientation. The subject is excellent in all ways: lighting, focus, color, etc. I like the processing. 8', '2007-03-23 19:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484182, 485828, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good shot, nice lighting. Just a touch too much room at the top.</td>', 'Good shot, nice lighting. Just a touch too much room at the top.', '2007-03-23 19:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484184, 485393, 5728, '<td valign="top">elegant!</td>', 'elegant!', '2007-03-23 19:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484186, 485587, 5728, '<td valign="top">Choice shot!</td>', 'Choice shot!', '2007-03-23 19:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484188, 483586, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see more light on his face.</td>', 'I''d like to see more light on his face.', '2007-03-23 19:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484192, 485375, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed. For me too much shoulder at the back and not enough hand at the front. Otherwise very cool!</td>', 'Very nice indeed. For me too much shoulder at the back and not enough hand at the front. Otherwise very cool!', '2007-03-23 19:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
