(3484230, 485229, 5728, '<td valign="top">Definitely a ribbon, excellent work. You have mastered the lighting on this perfectly..... I could learn from you. A definite 10!</td>', 'Definitely a ribbon, excellent work. You have mastered the lighting on this perfectly..... I could learn from you. A definite 10!', '2007-03-23 19:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
