(3485919, 485841, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wonderful backlighting, would do well in multiple light sources as well! Adorable the expression on her face.</td>', 'Wonderful backlighting, would do well in multiple light sources as well! Adorable the expression on her face.', '2007-03-24 20:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485925, 485274, 10858, '<td valign="top">White balance should be set up to avoid yellowish-redish tones next time. Needs more contrast as well, it is underexposed (needs more light) and composition is flat for me. Well, good view for a passport photo, but you could make it more interesting with a different angle. I think this will not do well in this challenge...</td>', 'White balance should be set up to avoid yellowish-redish tones next time. Needs more contrast as well, it is underexposed (needs more light) and composition is flat for me. Well, good view for a passport photo, but you could make it more interesting with a different angle. I think this will not do well in this challenge...', '2007-03-24 20:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485929, 485657, 10858, '<td valign="top">This extreme style and make-up looks very-very familiar to me. ;-) Great capture of emotions and extraordinarity!</td>', 'This extreme style and make-up looks very-very familiar to me. ;-) Great capture of emotions and extraordinarity!', '2007-03-24 20:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485936, 485829, 10858, '<td valign="top">Lights and shadows are harsh and it would work better if the eye was composed following the rule of thirds. Her hand is overexposed which is a little distracting and also her skin looks as it was over-neatimaged. Also a few artifacts of improper blurring can be realised on her face and hair (on the left size for example, the background texture totally disappears behind her hair).</td>', 'Lights and shadows are harsh and it would work better if the eye was composed following the rule of thirds. Her hand is overexposed which is a little distracting and also her skin looks as it was over-neatimaged. Also a few artifacts of improper blurring can be realised on her face and hair (on the left size for example, the background texture totally disappears behind her hair).', '2007-03-24 20:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485950, 485294, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice girl. This would work better if you cropped it tighter on the top. Also the harsh shadows caused by the flash are distracting.</td>', 'Nice girl. This would work better if you cropped it tighter on the top. Also the harsh shadows caused by the flash are distracting.', '2007-03-24 20:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485951, 485684, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great combination of textures, patterns and colours. Also the hand adds an interesting "plus" to the photo, I like this one.</td>', 'Great combination of textures, patterns and colours. Also the hand adds an interesting "plus" to the photo, I like this one.', '2007-03-24 20:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485956, 485645, 10858, '<td valign="top">Landscape cropped portraits work better with eyes following the rule of thirds or more negative space. Also the background is too busy here. Great idea to use the blue jewel with her blue eyes, but the cropping on the bottom does not seem ideal... would be better if there was a blue bubble on the left side of the necklace as well.</td>', 'Landscape cropped portraits work better with eyes following the rule of thirds or more negative space. Also the background is too busy here. Great idea to use the blue jewel with her blue eyes, but the cropping on the bottom does not seem ideal... would be better if there was a blue bubble on the left side of the necklace as well.', '2007-03-24 20:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485966, 485726, 10858, '<td valign="top">This is a snapshot... Needs more contrast, composition and a proper background. Try diffusing some light into her eyes (a golden diffusor would work well here) and avoid the blow out on the top of her hair. She has beautiful eyes and skin, keep trying with her.</td>', 'This is a snapshot... Needs more contrast, composition and a proper background. Try diffusing some light into her eyes (a golden diffusor would work well here) and avoid the blow out on the top of her hair. She has beautiful eyes and skin, keep trying with her.', '2007-03-24 20:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
