(3487373, 484464, 69722, '<td valign="top">I am new at this, so I hope I convey what I intend. While I find this photo very appealing for its colors, its subject, and its intricacy, I think it is probably overprocessed. Some of it seems too sharp to me, and areas like the white of the right shoulder seem blown out.</td>', 'I am new at this, so I hope I convey what I intend. While I find this photo very appealing for its colors, its subject, and its intricacy, I think it is probably overprocessed. Some of it seems too sharp to me, and areas like the white of the right shoulder seem blown out.', '2007-03-25 20:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
