(3487401, 485587, 55838, '<td valign="top">I like the tones in this shot.  She looks slightly blue but that is fitting for an "ice princess" after all.  Nice colors &amp; great eyes.  I''m not sure about the fuzzy texture of the purple and my eyes don''t care for the distracting heavy black border on this more subtle feeling shot.  All just subjective nits.  A very nice portrait and I''m back to bump you up to 8.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the tones in this shot.  She looks slightly blue but that is fitting for an "ice princess" after all.  Nice colors & great eyes.  I''m not sure about the fuzzy texture of the purple and my eyes don''t care for the distracting heavy black border on this more subtle feeling shot.  All just subjective nits.  A very nice portrait and I''m back to bump you up to 8.  Well done.', '2007-03-25 21:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3487406, 485334, 55838, '<td valign="top">Love this style of editing.  Great washed out whites and beautiful colors.  Very pretty.  Back to bump you up to 8.</td>', 'Love this style of editing.  Great washed out whites and beautiful colors.  Very pretty.  Back to bump you up to 8.', '2007-03-25 21:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3487417, 485535, 55838, '<td valign="top">Jeepers, you''re stressing me out just looking at this! : )  This man looks like someone who has lost everything dear to him - all is long gone.  The crop adds to the mood - no mouth so he''s silenced - nothing left to say -  and it feels tight like he''s caged.  Nice detail and shots (like yours) that demand some sort of emotional response from the viewer are truly art IMO.  Back to bump you up to 8.</td>', 'Jeepers, you''re stressing me out just looking at this! : )  This man looks like someone who has lost everything dear to him - all is long gone.  The crop adds to the mood - no mouth so he''s silenced - nothing left to say -  and it feels tight like he''s caged.  Nice detail and shots (like yours) that demand some sort of emotional response from the viewer are truly art IMO.  Back to bump you up to 8.', '2007-03-25 21:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
