(3487751, 485584, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''re getting hit for shooting an animal instead of a person, but that''s okay with me.  What I don''t like is that I can''t really see its face.</td>', 'I''m sure you''re getting hit for shooting an animal instead of a person, but that''s okay with me.  What I don''t like is that I can''t really see its face.', '2007-03-26 00:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
