(3488400, 485684, 60915, '<td valign="top">Hi Ivan. This is a nice portrait and your PP suits the subject very well. Just a couple of things that may have helped this along a bit. Perhaps placing your subject off centre could have helped the composition a little. Also, he seems out of place against the brick wall. Maybe moving him away from the wall and getting the background blurred a little, I think would have helped to make him stand out. Hope that helps. : )</td>', 'Hi Ivan. This is a nice portrait and your PP suits the subject very well. Just a couple of things that may have helped this along a bit. Perhaps placing your subject off centre could have helped the composition a little. Also, he seems out of place against the brick wall. Maybe moving him away from the wall and getting the background blurred a little, I think would have helped to make him stand out. Hope that helps. : )', '2007-03-26 09:08:43.000000', NULL, 0),
