(3488433, 485167, 66597, '<td valign="top">Jeffrey,<br/>Congrats on your awesome score, well deserved! I think you did a wonderful job with lighting and not over-processing this image. (I''m not a fan of that slick, waxy, death-by-processing look that some portrait take on.) I didn''t vote but would have given you top marks on this. And congrats to the lovely little lady as well :-)</td>', 'Jeffrey,Congrats on your awesome score, well deserved! I think you did a wonderful job with lighting and not over-processing this image. (I''m not a fan of that slick, waxy, death-by-processing look that some portrait take on.) I didn''t vote but would have given you top marks on this. And congrats to the lovely little lady as well :-)', '2007-03-26 09:25:11.000000', NULL, 0),
