(3488463, 485051, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lowcivicman99:</b></div><hr/><i> Judi, wow I am really amazed that you would do a shot like this. I really like it. you did a really good job. I seriously thought this was a Djabordjabor shot but I am really impressed. Great colors and very clear. Gave ya a 9 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thankyou so much.  Your comment really made me blush.  I have done this image before though...and this time around I was really just working on perfecting it.  I used exactly the same method and dropped the entire prep/shoot time down from 90 minutes to 10 minutes.<br/> <br/>Here is my first attempt from one year ago.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=314053" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/472/thumb/314053.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/472/thumb/314053.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/472/thumb/314053.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by Lowcivicman99: Judi, wow I am really amazed that you would do a shot like this. I really like it. you did a really good job. I seriously thought this was a Djabordjabor shot but I am really impressed. Great colors and very clear. Gave ya a 9   Thankyou so much.  Your comment really made me blush.  I have done this image before though...and this time around I was really just working on perfecting it.  I used exactly the same method and dropped the entire prep/shoot time down from 90 minutes to 10 minutes. Here is my first attempt from one year ago. ', '2007-03-26 09:37:41.000000', NULL, 0),
