(3488997, 485824, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the colors of the picture and the frame choice is a great balance.  I think it is hard to get quite the right lighting when it is not a "studio" shot.  So this is a great capture of a candid in my opinion.  This will make a great family memento!</td>', 'I love the colors of the picture and the frame choice is a great balance.  I think it is hard to get quite the right lighting when it is not a "studio" shot.  So this is a great capture of a candid in my opinion.  This will make a great family memento!', '2007-03-26 14:18:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3488999, 485491, 67697, '<td valign="top">Tell Tiffany to get smilin!  She''s getting married!  lol  What is great about this is that nothing is blown out and you can see the beautiful details of her dress.  Have fun practicing and I can''t wait to see the wedding results!</td>', 'Tell Tiffany to get smilin!  She''s getting married!  lol  What is great about this is that nothing is blown out and you can see the beautiful details of her dress.  Have fun practicing and I can''t wait to see the wedding results!', '2007-03-26 14:21:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3489017, 484807, 55199, '<td valign="top">Since it was mentioned, I do see the pixels that alliebeal points out in her comment.  But, I still think the photo deserves a far better score and placement than 225th place.  It may be a more candid portrait than the majority in the challenge, but it is not just a snapshot imo.</td>', 'Since it was mentioned, I do see the pixels that alliebeal points out in her comment.  But, I still think the photo deserves a far better score and placement than 225th place.  It may be a more candid portrait than the majority in the challenge, but it is not just a snapshot imo.', '2007-03-26 14:31:08.000000', NULL, 0),
