(3489200, 485772, 30982, '<td valign="top">The rather interesting thing I noticed about this one (other than the Team Suck unique angle approach) was that Elvis appears more lively than Johnny in this picture.</td>', 'The rather interesting thing I noticed about this one (other than the Team Suck unique angle approach) was that Elvis appears more lively than Johnny in this picture.', '2007-03-26 16:05:22.000000', NULL, 0),
