(3489207, 485816, 30982, '<td valign="top">The eyes were definitely the first thing I noticed on this - pleased to see that they aren''t photoshopped (though they didn''t look it to me.)  Good lookin'' guy you got there, too!  At first I wasn''t thrilled with the background, but the more I look at it, the more I think it adds to the shot, and fits.  Nice work!</td>', 'The eyes were definitely the first thing I noticed on this - pleased to see that they aren''t photoshopped (though they didn''t look it to me.)  Good lookin'' guy you got there, too!  At first I wasn''t thrilled with the background, but the more I look at it, the more I think it adds to the shot, and fits.  Nice work!', '2007-03-26 16:08:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3489214, 485815, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ma''am, that is indeed one fine lookin'' man you keep around.  And with those eyes... well... Let''s just leave it at that.  (Mesmerizing, they are.)  I love the toned version.  But I like this one, too, because, well, there are those blue eyes and all.</td>', 'Ma''am, that is indeed one fine lookin'' man you keep around.  And with those eyes... well... Let''s just leave it at that.  (Mesmerizing, they are.)  I love the toned version.  But I like this one, too, because, well, there are those blue eyes and all.', '2007-03-26 16:10:38.000000', NULL, 0),
