(3489238, 485581, 30982, '<td valign="top">I got a kick out of this one - very real and in the moment.  Love the title, by the way.  Not sure where all the 4 voters are coming from...  Did you take this with a flash?  You really need to get this young''un out into natural light - I think it''ll really bring out his eyes more.  He''s a good looking young lad!</td>', 'I got a kick out of this one - very real and in the moment.  Love the title, by the way.  Not sure where all the 4 voters are coming from...  Did you take this with a flash?  You really need to get this young''un out into natural light - I think it''ll really bring out his eyes more.  He''s a good looking young lad!', '2007-03-26 16:23:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3489245, 485659, 30982, '<td valign="top">Your daughter has incredible eyes!  I like the angle and the light coming over her shoulder, but I''m not sure I like the crop off the side of her face.  Keep shooting her - she''s an excellent model!</td>', 'Your daughter has incredible eyes!  I like the angle and the light coming over her shoulder, but I''m not sure I like the crop off the side of her face.  Keep shooting her - she''s an excellent model!', '2007-03-26 16:28:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3489249, 485785, 30982, '<td valign="top">Johnny, I presume?  He looks a bit more lively in yours.  :-)  Although both terrified and terrifying.  I really like how you added the color in "Color Portrait".  Very intriguing! (Edited to add a word.  My brain and my fingers are not on the best speaking terms at times.  I know what I meant - I''m hoping you did as well.)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-26 16:16:34.</i></td>', 'Johnny, I presume?  He looks a bit more lively in yours.  :-)  Although both terrified and terrifying.  I really like how you added the color in "Color Portrait".  Very intriguing! (Edited to add a word.  My brain and my fingers are not on the best speaking terms at times.  I know what I meant - I''m hoping you did as well.)', '2007-03-26 16:30:30.000000', '2007-03-26 17:16:34.000000', 0),
(3489253, 485257, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yay - another non-person person!  Though in the non-person category, xxrozxx''s goat definitely took the show.  Very nice duck, indeed!  Excellent DOF and bokeh on this.  And definitely good color!</td>', 'Yay - another non-person person!  Though in the non-person category, xxrozxx''s goat definitely took the show.  Very nice duck, indeed!  Excellent DOF and bokeh on this.  And definitely good color!', '2007-03-26 16:31:53.000000', NULL, 0),
