(3489299, 485175, 24389, '<td valign="top">I liked this idea - no one ever said it had to be a human portrait. Anyway, I was hoping that people wouldn''t be so cynical. Its lovely, I like the colors and the soft focus.</td>', 'I liked this idea - no one ever said it had to be a human portrait. Anyway, I was hoping that people wouldn''t be so cynical. Its lovely, I like the colors and the soft focus.', '2007-03-26 17:00:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3489305, 485175, 60173, '<td valign="top">I think this shot really did suffer from not exactly fitting the challenge. However it is a very nice photo with a great warm color.<br/> <br/>I feel like there''s something missing. I can''t quite put my finger on it. Maybe if the bear was holding a fresh flower cutting? Something to give the photo just a little more interest and personality.</td>', 'I think this shot really did suffer from not exactly fitting the challenge. However it is a very nice photo with a great warm color. I feel like there''s something missing. I can''t quite put my finger on it. Maybe if the bear was holding a fresh flower cutting? Something to give the photo just a little more interest and personality.', '2007-03-26 17:05:44.000000', NULL, 0),
