(3489449, 485229, 71657, '<td valign="top">First off, I didn''t call a lot of people fat asses.  Second, I said only 1 person was anorexic.  The person who posted this said he did not care how it scored, which is obviously untrue. I am only saying that if you can''t take criticism, don''t post anymore.  And if she''s not anorexic, well shame on me for sayiny it.  But shame on you for calling me and others fat asses, when most of us are probably skinnier than you.  Enjoy your 1st place ribbon and handle it like a professional.  And finally, I was not looking for a free nude pic, Toyan is the one who brought this up, I was just referencing my comment to his.  Congrats on your ribbon, and good luck in the future.  <br/> <br/>If you can''t handle the heat, stay out of the fire.</td>', 'First off, I didn''t call a lot of people fat asses.  Second, I said only 1 person was anorexic.  The person who posted this said he did not care how it scored, which is obviously untrue. I am only saying that if you can''t take criticism, don''t post anymore.  And if she''s not anorexic, well shame on me for sayiny it.  But shame on you for calling me and others fat asses, when most of us are probably skinnier than you.  Enjoy your 1st place ribbon and handle it like a professional.  And finally, I was not looking for a free nude pic, Toyan is the one who brought this up, I was just referencing my comment to his.  Congrats on your ribbon, and good luck in the future.   If you can''t handle the heat, stay out of the fire.', '2007-03-26 18:21:20.000000', NULL, 0),
