(3489634, 485603, 66384, '<td valign="top">Melethia,I voted 4 on this, not because of DNMC but because the shallow DOF bothers me. I wanted to see the whole iguana clearly. I love the color, texture, and patterns of their skin, and I don''t think it does justice to the subject to obscure most of him. That being said, I like the  pose you captured, and the light, color, and focus on his face is very nice. I got a laugh from the title too.</td>', 'Melethia,I voted 4 on this, not because of DNMC but because the shallow DOF bothers me. I wanted to see the whole iguana clearly. I love the color, texture, and patterns of their skin, and I don''t think it does justice to the subject to obscure most of him. That being said, I like the  pose you captured, and the light, color, and focus on his face is very nice. I got a laugh from the title too.', '2007-03-26 20:10:59.000000', NULL, 0),
