(3489672, 485652, 55838, '<td valign="top">5.8!  Not too shabby!  I paused on this image during voting because of the brightness and the soft focus.  I was attracted to both (as well the fantastic green).  Gives it a sort of "Field of Dreams" feel.  Cricket is not that big in the USA so I''m not sure what cricket fans are like but if they are anything like our baseball fans then I think the soft focus perfectly depicts the ethereal image of the game &amp; the players that the true fan seems to have. Anyway, those were my thoughts during voting.  7 from me.</td>', '5.8!  Not too shabby!  I paused on this image during voting because of the brightness and the soft focus.  I was attracted to both (as well the fantastic green).  Gives it a sort of "Field of Dreams" feel.  Cricket is not that big in the USA so I''m not sure what cricket fans are like but if they are anything like our baseball fans then I think the soft focus perfectly depicts the ethereal image of the game & the players that the true fan seems to have. Anyway, those were my thoughts during voting.  7 from me.', '2007-03-26 20:32:13.000000', NULL, 0),
