(3489680, 485659, 66384, '<td valign="top">Pretty girl. Nice crop and pose, and I think the focus is fine. The light is what I think hurts this shot. It''s a nice bright day but her face seems to be shaded. Have you ever played around with filter&gt;render&gt;lighting effects? A little touch of Omni light might be nice on this. BTW I like the little stray hair too. It makes it look more natural and adds a little highlight.</td>', 'Pretty girl. Nice crop and pose, and I think the focus is fine. The light is what I think hurts this shot. It''s a nice bright day but her face seems to be shaded. Have you ever played around with filter>render>lighting effects? A little touch of Omni light might be nice on this. BTW I like the little stray hair too. It makes it look more natural and adds a little highlight.', '2007-03-26 20:36:30.000000', NULL, 0),
