(3489751, 485855, 93, '<td valign="top">One of the better shots of the challenge for sure.<br/> <br/>This challenge kind of threw me for a loop, but I guess the old days when classic portraiture could still be top 10ish is fading.  Now you have to throw models in shells, have some kind of outstanding physical feature, cover them in flowers, or ...  be Librodo (snicker, sorry dude).  <br/> <br/>Still, top 20 is never bad is it?  I can''t even get into the top 200 anymore :)</td>', 'One of the better shots of the challenge for sure. This challenge kind of threw me for a loop, but I guess the old days when classic portraiture could still be top 10ish is fading.  Now you have to throw models in shells, have some kind of outstanding physical feature, cover them in flowers, or ...  be Librodo (snicker, sorry dude).   Still, top 20 is never bad is it?  I can''t even get into the top 200 anymore :)', '2007-03-26 21:19:56.000000', NULL, 0),
