(3489896, 485772, 32997, '<td valign="top">wow..one would think this was shot by a posthumous wannabe, attempting scoring suicide by ignoring everything photographic to provoke and stir up the collective...challenging and even yea, daring the masses to look beyond expection and accept the facts...the King is alive, and his name is Zirilli...<br/>(what is John hiding with his hands?)</td>', 'wow..one would think this was shot by a posthumous wannabe, attempting scoring suicide by ignoring everything photographic to provoke and stir up the collective...challenging and even yea, daring the masses to look beyond expection and accept the facts...the King is alive, and his name is Zirilli...(what is John hiding with his hands?)', '2007-03-26 22:24:59.000000', NULL, 0),
