(3490542, 485852, 30982, '<td valign="top">The main reason I dropped by your portfolio was to comment on this one.  I didn''t leave many comments during voting this time, but remembered that I wanted to come back and comment this one.  Glad to see it was yours.  This is one of those that makes you quietly linger and enjoy.  I particularly like the inclusion of the bird.  Normally I''d want your subject looking at the camera, but with the bird there, this works with him looking out of the frame.  As always, light is excellent.</td>', 'The main reason I dropped by your portfolio was to comment on this one.  I didn''t leave many comments during voting this time, but remembered that I wanted to come back and comment this one.  Glad to see it was yours.  This is one of those that makes you quietly linger and enjoy.  I particularly like the inclusion of the bird.  Normally I''d want your subject looking at the camera, but with the bird there, this works with him looking out of the frame.  As always, light is excellent.', '2007-03-27 05:55:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3490562, 485573, 70661, '<td valign="top">I like this alot Sandy, thought it would place much higher. She has that little teasing look in her eyes and a cute little grin. She looks very comfortable being photographed!</td>', 'I like this alot Sandy, thought it would place much higher. She has that little teasing look in her eyes and a cute little grin. She looks very comfortable being photographed!', '2007-03-27 06:22:50.000000', NULL, 0),
