(3490643, 484713, 63269, '<td valign="top">Oh grr! I had a feeling this wouldn''t score so great, but it''s so BEAUTIFUL! Sometimes I just can not understand the way the voting goes! ;)</td>', 'Oh grr! I had a feeling this wouldn''t score so great, but it''s so BEAUTIFUL! Sometimes I just can not understand the way the voting goes! ;)', '2007-03-27 08:19:52.000000', NULL, 0);
