(3490657, 484713, 48228, '<td valign="top">Way underrated Amy, as it is such a warm, loving, fun and happy portrait.....</td>', 'Way underrated Amy, as it is such a warm, loving, fun and happy portrait.....', '2007-03-27 08:31:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3490687, 485603, 11854, '<td valign="top">I see you made it to the zoo. Good for you! This is an excellent shot, and I personally love the DOF. The glass really is hard to shot through and I often run into the same type of problems (can''t back up because of glare and then they are too close). I didn''t enter or vote this challenge, but I would have given you a 10. You seem to have gotten quite a bit of his personality into the shot!</td>', 'I see you made it to the zoo. Good for you! This is an excellent shot, and I personally love the DOF. The glass really is hard to shot through and I often run into the same type of problems (can''t back up because of glare and then they are too close). I didn''t enter or vote this challenge, but I would have given you a 10. You seem to have gotten quite a bit of his personality into the shot!', '2007-03-27 08:47:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3490689, 485786, 67240, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. I have pretty much given up on this web site and the users abilities to rate images. You get a snapshot of some kid blowing out candles or something and it wins over shots like this. Just had to let you know it was awesome.</td>', 'This is a great shot. I have pretty much given up on this web site and the users abilities to rate images. You get a snapshot of some kid blowing out candles or something and it wins over shots like this. Just had to let you know it was awesome.', '2007-03-27 08:51:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3490728, 485603, 65886, '<td valign="top">:) yes, I liked the idea a lot! his color is perfect, and I like the dof too. but the most exciting thing for me here is his expression: just look at the way he is holding his head!! :) extremely cute. why do they always have the cutest expressions? :)</td>', ':) yes, I liked the idea a lot! his color is perfect, and I like the dof too. but the most exciting thing for me here is his expression: just look at the way he is holding his head!! :) extremely cute. why do they always have the cutest expressions? :)', '2007-03-27 09:51:47.000000', NULL, 0),
