(3490746, 483415, 65886, '<td valign="top">fantastic expression she has and the focus is perfect, the crop is excellent, too. I somehow like the crop a lot, because it is not something usual, not everyday child photo, but something different, and that uneasy feeling from the crop really adds a lot to the expression. maybe I would crop even more the hair up there, just a bit more, to make the crop even tighter?</td>', 'fantastic expression she has and the focus is perfect, the crop is excellent, too. I somehow like the crop a lot, because it is not something usual, not everyday child photo, but something different, and that uneasy feeling from the crop really adds a lot to the expression. maybe I would crop even more the hair up there, just a bit more, to make the crop even tighter?', '2007-03-27 10:04:30.000000', NULL, 0),
