(3491264, 485603, 32997, '<td valign="top">ok so who cares about the challenge..great shot, and love the DOF...as for the stick..I like it...works as a leading line, brings me back to the little guy...and perfectly clean backgrounds aren''t needed ALL the time...<br/>well done on this shot...</td>', 'ok so who cares about the challenge..great shot, and love the DOF...as for the stick..I like it...works as a leading line, brings me back to the little guy...and perfectly clean backgrounds aren''t needed ALL the time...well done on this shot...', '2007-03-27 15:26:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3491288, 485229, 17851, '<td valign="top">I think she looks healthy ;), and a long neck is great for models, one of the most important features I would say. Some people are just naturally skinny (lol Its hard for me to gain any wait :P). Congrats on the blue again! :)</td>', 'I think she looks healthy ;), and a long neck is great for models, one of the most important features I would say. Some people are just naturally skinny (lol Its hard for me to gain any wait :P). Congrats on the blue again! :)', '2007-03-27 15:48:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3491364, 484910, 30982, '<td valign="top">Woefully underrated.  I really was drawn to this one in the challenge and have been back to look at it a couple of times since then.  I quite like the intrigue, both of the photograph itself and with the title.  It''s also a wee bit haunting.</td>', 'Woefully underrated.  I really was drawn to this one in the challenge and have been back to look at it a couple of times since then.  I quite like the intrigue, both of the photograph itself and with the title.  It''s also a wee bit haunting.', '2007-03-27 16:20:08.000000', NULL, 0),
