(3491992, 485127, 45475, '<td valign="top">Two things, in my eyes, that I felt you nailed: the vignette - it really lifts the shot to another level, and the saturation - the wonderful dirty(?) reds give this a feel of old photographs you might find in your parent''s album of when you were a child. Remember those? The one''s where colour was added by the photographer manually later? Ahhh yes... I got that melancholy feeling alright... :)</td>', 'Two things, in my eyes, that I felt you nailed: the vignette - it really lifts the shot to another level, and the saturation - the wonderful dirty(?) reds give this a feel of old photographs you might find in your parent''s album of when you were a child. Remember those? The one''s where colour was added by the photographer manually later? Ahhh yes... I got that melancholy feeling alright... :)', '2007-03-27 22:19:25.000000', NULL, 0),
