(3502199, 485535, 69102, '<td valign="top">Didn''t get to vote on this challenge, but this would have been a high scorer from me. Excellent, raw self-portraiture. I think the title is great (if for nothing else that you didn''t name it "windows to the soul"). ;) There is an abstract sense about this, that I think the title pulls out and plays with. The "weathering" of your face evokes an expansive, varied, and not always serene landscape. There is the sense of seeing the effects of your travels, as well as the paths themselves. Excellent work.</td>', 'Didn''t get to vote on this challenge, but this would have been a high scorer from me. Excellent, raw self-portraiture. I think the title is great (if for nothing else that you didn''t name it "windows to the soul"). ;) There is an abstract sense about this, that I think the title pulls out and plays with. The "weathering" of your face evokes an expansive, varied, and not always serene landscape. There is the sense of seeing the effects of your travels, as well as the paths themselves. Excellent work.', '2007-03-31 15:23:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3502323, 485426, 20124, '<td valign="top">She''s the best part of the photo. (expression on her face, body position,<br/>skin tone, outfit design and color) However, the light coming through<br/>the bottom part of the window is a bit too bright, distractingly so.<br/> But she more than compensates for this minor flaw.<br/>  Still quite good overall.   A Seven. :-)</td>', 'She''s the best part of the photo. (expression on her face, body position,skin tone, outfit design and color) However, the light coming throughthe bottom part of the window is a bit too bright, distractingly so. But she more than compensates for this minor flaw.  Still quite good overall.   A Seven. :-)', '2007-03-31 16:26:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3502499, 485552, 52130, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, I just think thath the background should have been less busy on the upper portion. Maybe another color backgrond in addition to the red might have helped.</td>', 'I like the idea, I just think thath the background should have been less busy on the upper portion. Maybe another color backgrond in addition to the red might have helped.', '2007-03-31 18:27:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3502505, 485689, 52130, '<td valign="top">I agree with the karmat''s comment. It''s anice portrit, but other than that, it doesn''t really stick out that mush. I''n not saying it''s OOF, but I think if it had been sharper, it would have scored higer.</td>', 'I agree with the karmat''s comment. It''s anice portrit, but other than that, it doesn''t really stick out that mush. I''n not saying it''s OOF, but I think if it had been sharper, it would have scored higer.', '2007-03-31 18:31:06.000000', NULL, 0),
