(3511762, 485652, 29293, '<td valign="top">i loved the super saturation</td>', 'i loved the super saturation', '2007-04-02 20:58:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3512444, 483415, 50641, '<td valign="top">Oh what an expression... great title! She even appears to be lifting one brow! I love what you did with the processing - it looks so professional - the glow from the white at the bottom...    For the purposes of DPCisms, yah, probably a tighter crop would have put her eyes on a thirds line (although I think the hair is interesting).  Also, what I''ve noticed is that dpc voters will forgive almost anything if the eyes are sharp.  I mean, look at 3rd place in the pop culture challenge.. editing nightmare but the dumb eyes are sharp.  Possibly this child''s eyes could have been dodged, saturated and sharpened and that would have gotten a higher vote. But me, I don''t think this picture is too soft.  And I love the natural, totally realistic skin tones and the damp curls.  It befits the expression perfectly.  Highly underrated shot, yes indeed.</td>', 'Oh what an expression... great title! She even appears to be lifting one brow! I love what you did with the processing - it looks so professional - the glow from the white at the bottom...    For the purposes of DPCisms, yah, probably a tighter crop would have put her eyes on a thirds line (although I think the hair is interesting).  Also, what I''ve noticed is that dpc voters will forgive almost anything if the eyes are sharp.  I mean, look at 3rd place in the pop culture challenge.. editing nightmare but the dumb eyes are sharp.  Possibly this child''s eyes could have been dodged, saturated and sharpened and that would have gotten a higher vote. But me, I don''t think this picture is too soft.  And I love the natural, totally realistic skin tones and the damp curls.  It befits the expression perfectly.  Highly underrated shot, yes indeed.', '2007-04-02 23:42:48.000000', NULL, 0),
