(3562004, 485167, 64994, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> Woo hoo, Jeff!  Glad you are going to be looking at this beautiful little girl every time you go to your profile for a while :)  Congratulations on an awesome portrait and an awesome finish!  You know you will enjoy this one forever -- long after the challenge is forgotten :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah, this comment says it all I think...thats what this is all about for me, a great photo...but also a great memory...way to go!!! great shot!!! challenges come and go...but a emotional shot like this lives forever...great image...</td>', 'Originally posted by SandyP: Woo hoo, Jeff!  Glad you are going to be looking at this beautiful little girl every time you go to your profile for a while :)  Congratulations on an awesome portrait and an awesome finish!  You know you will enjoy this one forever -- long after the challenge is forgotten :)   Yeah, this comment says it all I think...thats what this is all about for me, a great photo...but also a great memory...way to go!!! great shot!!! challenges come and go...but a emotional shot like this lives forever...great image...', '2007-04-19 02:50:52.000000', NULL, 0),
