(3779504, 484641, 79657, '<td valign="top">I always love a natural pose with natural smile portrait. You maintained the details very well. Very lovely composition too. One little tiny winny thing: Maybe you can sharpen or add more contrast on her eyes ^.~ She has beautiful eyes indeed.</td>', 'I always love a natural pose with natural smile portrait. You maintained the details very well. Very lovely composition too. One little tiny winny thing: Maybe you can sharpen or add more contrast on her eyes ^.~ She has beautiful eyes indeed.', '2007-06-13 17:34:49.000000', NULL, 0),
